  "about": {
    "title": "About the Next Destinies set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Next Destinies is a Black & White expansion released on 8 February 2012. It has 103 cards: 99 in the main set and 4 secret rares. There are also 87 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 99 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (186 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 190 cards, adding the 4 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
